<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Telugu strings.

  Written as natural Telugu rather than a word-for-word rendering of the
  English: "eating window" becomes "ఆహారం తీసుకునే సమయం" (the time during which
  food is taken), because a literal "window" would read as a window in a wall.

  Product names (NutriLens) and units (g, ml, kcal) stay in Latin script, which
  is how they are written and read in Telugu technical text.

  Every key from values/strings.xml is present. A missing key would silently
  fall back to English mid-screen.
-->
